      "kind": "markdown",
      "value": "**`@focus`**\n\n_Vue event listener_\n\nShorthand for `v-on:event`. The handler runs in component scope.\n\n**Example**\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <button @focus=\"handler\"></button>\n</template>\n```\n\n**Docs**\n\n[Vue event handling](https://vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html)"
